  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Mapping study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is meant to develop the water strategy of the Dutch Embassy in Algiers and will serve as input for the Multi Annual Country Strategy (2026-2029). The objective of the water strategy, and therefore this study, is to identify the water-management needs and demands of Algeria&#x2019;s public and private sectors that are relevant to Dutch expertise, particularly within the MACS themes of &#x201c;D. Energy &amp; Water&#x201d; and &#x201c;E. Trade, Entrepreneurship &amp; Agriculture&#x201d;. In the short term, the project will provide strategic input for future programming (PSD, CWF, other). In the long term, it aims to strengthen trade opportunities for the Dutch private sector while contributing to economic stability in Algeria.</narrative>
  </description>
